msgid "HELP_BODY"
msgstr ""
"[center][font_size=40]Tempora[/font_size]\n"
"by kongehund[/center]\n"
"\n"
"[font_size=25]Getting started[/font_size]\n"
"Drag an .mp3 or .ogg file into Tempora to load a song.\n"
"Each row is one measure. The red line marks where a measure starts.\n"
"A downbeat is the first beat you hear in a measure. Match each downbeat to the red line, then export for your rhythm game.\n"
"\n"
"[font_size=25]Listen[/font_size]\n"
"[i]Space\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Start / stop playback\n"
"[i]Right-click\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Start playback from the clicked position\n"
"\n"
"[font_size=25]Timing[/font_size]\n"
"A timing point pins the music to the grid.\n"
"1. Find a downbeat by ear.\n"
"2. Click that position or drag the red line.\n"
"3. Repeat for every downbeat.\n"
"4. Play back (slow it down if needed) and fix any drift.\n"
"\n"
"[i]Click\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Create a timing point\n"
"[i]Hold Shift\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Snap to the grid when placing a point\n"
"[i]Double-click\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Remove a timing point\n"
"[i]Shift + Scroll wheel\t\t\t\t[/i] Nudge the nearest point's offset, or its selection. (alt = larger steps)\n"
"[i]Ctrl + Scroll wheel\t\t\t\t[/i] Change the nearest point's BPM (last point only). (alt = larger steps, shift = smaller steps)\n"
"\n"
"With the cursor on a timing point (or while holding one):\n"
"[i]Drag\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Move the point along the timeline\n"
"[i]Shift + Drag\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Change its offset, or the selected points' offsets\n"
"[i]Ctrl + Drag\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Change its BPM (last point only)\n"
"\n"
"Scroll shortcuts also work with trackpad scrolling.\n"
"\n"
"Beats between downbeats? Raise the \"Grid\" slider (e.g. to 2) to add points inside a measure.\n"
"Set the time signature on the left (default 4/4).\n"
"\n"
"[font_size=25]Export[/font_size]\n"
"Open the [i]File[/i] menu and pick an export.\n"
"\n"
"[font_size=25]Audio[/font_size]\n"
"Set the volumes in the top right. The metronome plays every 1/4 note by default.\n"
"[i]\"Playback\"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Change the playback rate\n"
"[i]X\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Toggle the playback rate between two states\n"
"[i]Hold Z\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Mute the metronome\n"
"\n"
"[font_size=25]Navigation & shortcuts[/font_size]\n"
"[i]Scroll wheel\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Move the timeline\n"
"\t[i]+ Alt\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Jump 5 measures\n"
"[i]Ctrl + S\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Save project\n"
"[i]Ctrl + Z / Y\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Undo / Redo\n"
"[i]Ctrl + A\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Select all timing points\n"
"[i]Delete / Backspace\t\t\t\t[/i] Delete selected timing points\n"
"[i]Alt + Click + drag\t\t\t\t\t[/i] Select / deselect timing points\n"
"[i]Alt + Click\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[/i] (on a timing point) Select / deselect\n"
"[i]Alt + Double-click / Esc\t\t[/i] Deselect all timing points\n"
"\n"
"The [i]File[/i] menu also has New Project, Open and Save As.\n"
"\n"
"[font_size=25]Options[/font_size]\n"
"[b]Preserve BPM on new time signature[/b]\n"
"When on, changing the time signature keeps each later point's BPM instead of its position.\n"
"[font_size=6] [/font_size]\n"
"[b]Metronome Follows Grid[/b]\n"
"Metronome plays at every grid line instead of at quarter-note positions.\n"
"[font_size=6] [/font_size]\n"
"[b]Show All Settings[/b]\n"
"Reveals additional timeline settings.\n"
"\n"

